	Recalling that it is beneficial for chaotic characters to
sacrifce human corpses (on chaotic altars, natch) I offered a few
were-things to Loki with my Level 8 Valkyrie. Imagine my surprise
when the messages came up (every single time!):
		"You have summoned a demon lord! (more)"
		"You are frozen with fear! (more)"
		"You can move again."
	What's up here? So far I have Jubilex, Yeenoghu, and an
unnamed nalfeshnee wandering around dungeon level 2(!) They are
peaceful enough, but what's the big idea? Does this mean I won't
have to deal with them later? Is this Loki's way of telling me
to cut it out with the human thing? Has this happened to anyone
else out there?
	While I'm at it, I would like to offer a great big
thank-you to all the folks who offered help with my Nymph question
a while back. Everyone had something useful to add that I had never
thought of. Nymphs are _much_ easier to deal with now.
